# Mutation plan for the OpenGraph half of link previews: the x/net tokenizer and entity decoding
# (mm_model::go_html), charset detection (go_charset), dyatlov's parser and Go's RFC 3339 parse
# (opengraph), TruncateOpenGraph and friends (link_metadata), ResolveReference (go_url), and
# parseOpenGraphMetadata / oEmbed (mm_app::opengraph). All unit: the oracle is
# fixtures/behaviour_opengraph.json and behaviour_go_url.json, no stack needed.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/opengraph.plan
#
# Not planned, because the mutation is unobservable by construction: x/net's numeric clamp at
# 0x10FFFF (both sides then answer U+FFFD), the longest-prefix order of the no-semicolon match
# (no corpus entity has two matching prefixes), and exact-before-folded oEmbed field matching
# (no two OEmbedResponse names fold together).
#
# Tab-separated: name<TAB>file<TAB>from<TAB>to<TAB>suite<TAB>filter.  `\n` becomes a newline.

